# Runtime uploads — guest photos and session images are stored under public/ by
# the dashboard (GuestPhoto / SessionImage), so a stray `git add` must never
# sweep them into the repo. about/ and partners/ are static content and stay
# tracked. The already-committed guest photos remain tracked deliberately: they
# are how the live site's images reach production, and untracking them would
# delete them there on the next deploy.
/public/assets/2026/sessions/*
!/public/assets/2026/sessions/.gitkeep
/public/assets/2026/guests/*
!/public/assets/2026/guests/.gitkeep
